# Caldermont

A responsive, static web application designed for asset recovery and inquiry management. Built with modern HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript.

## Features

- **Smooth Scroll Navigation:** Dynamic navigation and section scrolling.
- **Interactive FAQ:** Custom JS accordion for interactive support queries.
- **Client-Side Form Handling:** Integrates EmailJS for inquiries with rate limiting and automated spam honeypot filters.
- **Responsive Testimonial Slider:** Dynamic carousel layout with autoplay.

## Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6)
- **Services:** EmailJS (Form API)
- **Deployment & Hosting:** Vercel, Namecheap DNS

## Getting Started Locally

To run this project locally, clone the repository and open `index.html` in your browser:

\`\`\`bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/your-username/caldermont.git

# Navigate into the directory
cd caldermont
\`\`\`

Open `index.html` directly or use Live Server in VS Code.

## Security Configuration

- Enforces HTTP Security Headers via `vercel.json` (`X-Frame-Options`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, `Referrer-Policy`).
- Rate limiting and bot detection enabled via EmailJS.

